hows trust and softness around Columbina.\n\n<Subject 2>\n <picture 2> \nColumbina\nIdentity:\nA mysterious moon goddess with an elegant and gentle presence.\nAppearance:\nLong straight black hair fading into dark purple tips. Distinctive white feathered angel wings on her head. Wearing a navy blue blazer over a clean white blouse, high-waisted black trousers and classic black pumps. Carrying a small elegant handbag.\nPersonality:\nSoft-spoken, mature, nurturing, quietly confident. Her warmth contrasts with the cold modern environment.\n\n\n\n### **Cinematic Prompt Set (English Output)**\n[Shot 1 | 0-4s]\nCamera\n\nWide-angle cinematic interior shot.\n\nCamera position:\nSlightly low angle, emphasizing the spacious modern apartment and the floor-to-ceiling windows overlooking the city.\n\nMovement:\nSlow cinematic dolly-in toward the two characters.\n\nComposition\n\nDeep depth of field.\n\nForeground:\nColumbina enters from the right side carrying two cups.\n\nMid-ground:\nSandrone sits on a dark luxury sofa, carefully examining a small mechanical component.\n\nBackground:\nLarge glass windows reveal a rainy neon city skyline, soft reflections on the glass.\n\nVisual\n\nCool blue city light fills the room.\n\nSandrone is illuminated by subtle cold lighting, emphasizing her mechanical and professional atmosphere.\n\nColumbina is surrounded by warmer golden rim light, highlighting her white feather accessories and gentle presence.\n\nAction\n\nColumbina quietly places a cup beside Sandrone.\n\nShe leans slightly forward, observing the mechanical device in Sandrone’s hand.\n\nHer movement is calm and caring, without interrupting Sandrone's work.\n\nPerformance\n\nColumbina:\nA gentle smile, slightly tilting her head, showing concern.\n\nSandrone:\nFocused expression, eyes fixed on the mechanical component, maintaining a serious professional attitude.\n\nDialogue\n\nColumbina:\n\"你又忘记休息了。\"\n\nVoice:\nMature female voice, soft and nurturing, calm rhythm.\n\nSandrone:\n\"机械不会抱怨。\"\n\nVoice:\nCool professional female voice, slightly husky, controlled and confident.\n\nSound\n\nSoft cup placement sound.\n\nQuiet mechanical humming.\n\nRain tapping against the window.\n\nDistant city ambience.\n\n[Shot 2 | 4-9s]\nCamera\n\nMedium close-up.\n\nCamera:\nOver-the-shoulder perspective focusing on both faces.\n\nMovement:\nVery subtle handheld movement, creating emotional intimacy.\n\nComposition\n\nThe two characters occupy the same frame.\n\nWarm lamp light illuminates Columbina.\n\nCool shadows remain around Sandrone.\n\nTheir contrasting personalities are visually emphasized.\n\nAction\n\nColumbina gently reaches out and fixes a loose strand of Sandrone’s hair.\n\nSandrone pauses.\n\nFor a brief moment, her usual calm expression breaks.\n\nThey slowly move closer.\n\nTheir faces are only a few centimeters apart.\n\nTheir lips almost touch, but they naturally stop before crossing the boundary.\n\nA quiet moment of emotional tension.\n\nNo kiss.\n\nPerformance\n\nColumbina:\nSoft eyes, calm smile, quietly teasing but caring.\n\nSandrone:\nA brief surprised expression, slight hesitation, then slowly relaxing.\n\nHer defensive attitude begins to soften.\n\nDialogue\n\nColumbina:\n\"哼哼～～\"\n\nVoice:\nLight, playful, gentle tone.\n\nSound\n\nBreathing becomes slightly noticeable.\n\nRain sound grows softer.\n\nMechanical sounds fade into the background.\n\n[Shot 3 | 9-13s]\nCamera\n\nExtreme close-up.\n\nFocus starts on Sandrone’s eyes.\n\nSlow rack focus toward Columbina.\n\nComposition\n\nBackground completely blurred.\n\nThe frame captures subtle emotional changes.\n\nVisual\n\nSandrone’s cold expression slowly disappears.\n\nA small moment of vulnerability appears.\n\nShe avoids direct eye contact, trying to regain composure.\n\nColumbina watches with a knowing gentle smile.\n\nAction\n\nColumbina remains close for a moment, quietly observing Sandrone’s reaction.\n\nSandrone finally looks away, pretending to return to her usual calm state.\n\nDialogue\n\nSandrone:\n\"在测试我的耐心吗？\"\n\nVoice:\nSoft, slightly frustrated, restrained emotion.\n\nColumbina:\n\"只是确认，你也会害羞。\"\n\nVoice:\nWarm, mature, affectionate tone.\n\nSound\n\nA quiet sigh from Sandrone.\n\nA soft laugh from Columbina.\n\n[Shot 4 | 13-15s]\nCamera\n\nWide cinematic shot.\n\nCamera slowly pulls back.\n\nComposition\n\nReturn to the apartment view.\n\nThe city lights and rainy window create a peaceful atmosphere.\n\nThe two characters sit side by side on the sofa.\n\nAction\n\nSandrone lightly pushes Columbina away with her shoulder.\n\nA small playful gesture.\n\nAfter a moment, she quietly rests her head against Columbina’s shoulder.\n\nColumbina smiles and covers both of them with a blanket.\n\nPerformance\n\nColumbina:\nA warm, genuine smile.\n\nSandrone:\nRelaxed posture, finally showing trust.\n\nSound\n\nBlanket movement.\n\nSoft laughter.\n\nRain outside.\n\nMusic\n\nA gentle emotional piano melody slowly rises."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [-1460.0047607421875, 5887.88671875], "id": 138, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [261], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "FLOAT"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [15], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveFloat", "title": "Float (Duration)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [270, 70], "pos": [-1449.4395751953125, 5652.74951171875], "id": 132, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_